<title>UK: Yorks Electricity H1 profits slip, div jumps.</title>
<headline>Yorks Electricity H1 profits slip, div jumps.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		39.3		   vs 45.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 15.8		   vs 11.88</p>
<p> Pretax		     80.8		   vs 110.6</p>
<p> Turnover		   608.3		  vs 620.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 76.0 and 95.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Yorkshire Electricity Group Plc</p>
</text>
